    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/abd511dac13ee8595f8738bfa7723354.avif?t=1752564301\" width=718 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arcane Limbo</i></strong> is a co-op roguelike action RPG where four unlikely heroes are trapped in a cursed cycle between life and death. Dive into the arcane void with up to 4 players as you fight your way through ever-shifting dungeons, uncover lost powers, and defy the dungeon master that controls your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/e8b4280a86e54ab0bd0d6dfbdf1fd62c.avif?t=1752564301\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the elements! Light, shadow, earth and ice. With fluid, impactful spellcasting, blending strategy with raw mystical energy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/5c8c4a820901cfa64b09c26c4fffcdac.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/5c8c4a820901cfa64b09c26c4fffcdac.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/5c8c4a820901cfa64b09c26c4fffcdac.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step through spectral forests, shattered ruins, and ethereal landscapes. Every realm brims with hidden lore, haunting ambiance, and visual storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/c5b3080ee0f946c6b185193e5466be55.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/c5b3080ee0f946c6b185193e5466be55.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/c5b3080ee0f946c6b185193e5466be55.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Spellcasting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with friends, solve puzzles together and unleash spell combos that amplify your powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/ff7c1ed874c5be6ec86eccabeaea01a0.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/ff7c1ed874c5be6ec86eccabeaea01a0.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/ff7c1ed874c5be6ec86eccabeaea01a0.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control behind the curtain! Spawn enemies, craft events, and design sessions in real-time or save them for others to triumph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/42405640d701ce69f65e42ada85bca45.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/42405640d701ce69f65e42ada85bca45.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/42405640d701ce69f65e42ada85bca45.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Skills &amp; Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful runes and discover new combinations, as you progress. Each new ability or enchanted item redefines your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/d2d7c12124105e79a1e5caeadf57de7f.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/d2d7c12124105e79a1e5caeadf57de7f.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/d2d7c12124105e79a1e5caeadf57de7f.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monumental bosses, learn attack patterns, exploit weaknesses. Defeat them and earn legendary rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/b59eb27e49e5e94aa0547a0d6660eaf9.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/b59eb27e49e5e94aa0547a0d6660eaf9.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/b59eb27e49e5e94aa0547a0d6660eaf9.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/abd511dac13ee8595f8738bfa7723354.avif?t=1752564301\" width=718 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arcane Limbo</i></strong> is a co-op roguelike action RPG where four unlikely heroes are trapped in a cursed cycle between life and death. Dive into the arcane void with up to 4 players as you fight your way through ever-shifting dungeons, uncover lost powers, and defy the dungeon master that controls your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/e8b4280a86e54ab0bd0d6dfbdf1fd62c.avif?t=1752564301\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the elements! Light, shadow, earth and ice. With fluid, impactful spellcasting, blending strategy with raw mystical energy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/5c8c4a820901cfa64b09c26c4fffcdac.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/5c8c4a820901cfa64b09c26c4fffcdac.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/5c8c4a820901cfa64b09c26c4fffcdac.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step through spectral forests, shattered ruins, and ethereal landscapes. Every realm brims with hidden lore, haunting ambiance, and visual storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/c5b3080ee0f946c6b185193e5466be55.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/c5b3080ee0f946c6b185193e5466be55.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/c5b3080ee0f946c6b185193e5466be55.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Spellcasting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with friends, solve puzzles together and unleash spell combos that amplify your powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/ff7c1ed874c5be6ec86eccabeaea01a0.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/ff7c1ed874c5be6ec86eccabeaea01a0.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/ff7c1ed874c5be6ec86eccabeaea01a0.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control behind the curtain! Spawn enemies, craft events, and design sessions in real-time or save them for others to triumph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/42405640d701ce69f65e42ada85bca45.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/42405640d701ce69f65e42ada85bca45.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/42405640d701ce69f65e42ada85bca45.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Skills &amp; Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful runes and discover new combinations, as you progress. Each new ability or enchanted item redefines your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/d2d7c12124105e79a1e5caeadf57de7f.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/d2d7c12124105e79a1e5caeadf57de7f.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/d2d7c12124105e79a1e5caeadf57de7f.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monumental bosses, learn attack patterns, exploit weaknesses. Defeat them and earn legendary rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/b59eb27e49e5e94aa0547a0d6660eaf9.poster.avif?t=1752564301\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/b59eb27e49e5e94aa0547a0d6660eaf9.webm?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704110/extras/b59eb27e49e5e94aa0547a0d6660eaf9.mp4?t=1752564301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
